Fix database-init crash, missing-database crash and tree/mauve robustness

- fix #39: load_annotation_file reads snp_references via self.conn instead of calling flextaxd get_genomes with an unsupported 'table' keyword
- fix #40: ParseXMFA.run raises a clear ValueError when no database is given, instead of crashing in sqlite3.connect(False)
- NewickTree.new_node: skip a node whose missing parent has no link in the tree table, instead of unpacking None from get_parent
- runMauve: add the missing cleanup() method and use run()'s 'database' argument instead of undefined 'args'
